:: junction default

> @opening
  [Junction. N-2 is stamped on the stair door behind you.]

> speaker=Technician @again
  Again.

> speaker=Recording @recording
  Left at the junction. You’ll hear the fans before you reach the chamber.

? @power
  Restore auxiliary power.
  -> power

? @plan
  Unfold the survey plan.
  -> plan

:: power
> @fans
  [A contactor closes. The lights hold. Fans gather speed beyond the partition; through the grille between the doors comes a knock that misses every third turn.]
-> END

:: plan
> @shaft
  [The paper opens along an old repair. It shows a stair south of the junction. N-2 is marked as a cable shaft. Neither chamber has a name.]
-> END
